nt II,&lt;/strong&gt; you&#39;ll be at the forefront of making that happen for our customers.&amp;nbsp; You will be the customer-facing technical expert and GTM presales advisor who directly partners with our Account Executives to lead discovery, design tailored solutions, deliver compelling demos, and guide technical validation that drives deal velocity. You&#39;ll serve as a trusted advisor to prospects across multiple personas and technical environments, translating Apollo&#39;s platform capabilities into real business value.&lt;/p&gt;
