&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re currently designing GTM campaigns, workflows, and systems agentically. MCP isn&#39;t a buzzword to you — it&#39;s how you work.&lt;/li&gt;
