&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive-ready:&lt;/strong&gt; You present confidently to C-suite stakeholders, adapt your message to the audience, and can hold a strategic business conversation as easily as a technical one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-obsessed:&lt;/strong&gt; You build lasting relationships and raving fans. Your accounts don&#39;t churn because they don&#39;t want to leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retention &amp;gt;95% across your Mid-Market book&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent credit consumption uplift (10%+ NRR)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seat expansion and CSQL generation&lt;/li&gt;
