&lt;li&gt;Have at least 2 years of experience directly managing a team of 6+ account executives in net new closing experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top performer in your current role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of consistently meeting team targets, min of 3 trailing quarters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using and coaching teams to have strong consultative selling skills &amp;amp; sales process in their day to day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must have a C1 English Level&lt;/li&gt;
