onnected TV, Performance Audio, Out-of-Home, and Direct Mail/Gifting. You are a master of driving top-of-funnel brand awareness in a highly quantifiable way, bringing the rigor of performance marketing to channels that are often treated as unmeasurable. You will partner closely with the Paid Acquisition team and the Creative org to build programs that are both brand-building and business-driving, with the measurement frameworks to prove it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
