&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the Creative team on briefs, concepts, and production, ensuring channel-specific creative is compelling and performance-oriented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage media buying relationships, vendor partnerships, and agency collaborations across all owned channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing Analytics &amp;amp; Data Science to build robust measurement frameworks and reporting infrastructure for offline and upper-funnel channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with Brand, Sales, and Finance to align channel programs with pipeline goals and budget priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in performance or brand marketing, with hands-on ownership of direct and offline channels (CTV, audio, OOH, direct mail) at a high-growth B2B SaaS company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in incrementality measurement, geo holdout testing, halo effect studies, matched market experiments, and brand lift studies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong creative partnership skills, able to write compelling briefs, give sharp feedback, and collaborate with design and video teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with programmatic CTV and audio buying platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with direct mail and gifting platforms and how to integrate them into broader demand generation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly analytical with a performance marketing mindset, comfortable defining KPIs, building measurement plans, and presenting results with statistical rigor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within ABM frameworks and aligning offline programs to target account lists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build programs from scratch in a fast-moving, cross-functional environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
