&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;http://apollo.io/&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-7a57a4e3-9668-4c92-9fb1-a9318bf3a91b--723603012&quot;&gt;Apollo.io&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the leading go-to-market solution for revenue teams, trusted by over 500,000 companies and millions of users globally, from rapidly growing startups to some of the world&#39;s largest enterprises. Founded in 2015, the company is one of the fastest growing companies in SaaS, raising approximately $250 million to date and valued at $1.6 billion. &lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;http://apollo.io/&quot; data-token-index=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-7a57a4e3-9668-4c92-9fb1-a9318bf3a91b--723603012&quot;&gt;Apollo.io&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; provides sales and marketing teams with easy access to verified contact data for over 210 million B2B contacts and 35 million companies worldwide, along with tools to engage and convert these contacts in one unified platform. By helping revenue professionals find the most accurate contact information and automating the outreach process, &lt;a class=&quot;notion-link-token notion-focusable-token notion-enable-hover&quot; href=&quot;http://apollo.io/&quot; data-token-index=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-7a57a4e3-9668-4c92-9fb1-a9318bf3a91b--723603012&quot;&gt;Apollo.io&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; turns prospects into customers.&amp;nbsp;Apollo raised a series D in 2023 and is backed by top-tier investors, including Sequoia Capital, Bain Capital Ventures, and more, and counts the former President and COO of Hubspot, JD Sherman, among its board members.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Enablement &amp;amp; the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enablement exists to be a strategic partner to our GTM roles—building role proficiency through clear, scalable programs that align to business priorities. We drive accountability and adoption so teams execute with confidence, deliver exceptional customer experiences, and achieve our revenue outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Senior Enablement Manager, EMEA&lt;/strong&gt;, you’ll be &lt;strong&gt;Apollo’s first dedicated enablement hire in EMEA&lt;/strong&gt;, helping shape how enablement supports one of our most important growth regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll serve as the strategic enablement partner and primary point of contact for EMEA Revenue, bridging global enablement and GTM strategy to local field execution. You’ll work closely with EMEA Sales Leadership and frontline managers to identify the highest-impact performance opportunities, strengthen seller and manager proficiency, and improve execution across the sales motion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll have primary field enablement responsibility for our EMEA Account Executive and Account Management teams and serve as the local enablement partner for BDRs, Solutions Consultants, GTM Engineers, and the broader EMEA Revenue organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Apollo continues to grow and hire across EMEA, &lt;strong&gt;new-hire onboarding and ramp will be a significant focus for this role.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll partner closely with our Global Onboarding Program Manager to drive the global Revenue onboarding experience in EMEA, support new hires through their first 90 days, and ensure regional insights continuously improve the global program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also partner closely with the North America-based Sales Enablement Manager and global functional partners to scale what works, maintain consistency where it matters, and ensure EMEA insights help shape our broader enablement strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior individual contributor role with significant autonomy and influence. We’re looking for someone who can move comfortably from diagnosing a business problem to setting strategy, aligning senior stakeholders, building the solution, and driving measurable adoption and impact in the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with EMEA Sales Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Work directly with Sales Leadership and frontline managers to diagnose performance opportunities and improve pipeline quality, deal progression, win rates, and overall field execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive global onboarding in EMEA:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with the Global Onboarding Program Manager to deliver and reinforce Apollo’s global Revenue onboarding program in EMEA, supporting new hires throughout their first 90 days and partnering with managers to drive successful ramp. Surface regional insights and feedback to continuously improve the global onboarding experience as Apollo scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own ongoing &amp;amp; everboarding enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and deliver ongoing development for EMEA AEs and AMs that strengthens seller proficiency and addresses evolving skill and execution gaps. Own regional certification and readiness, establishing and reinforcing a clear standard for what “good” looks like across EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Translate global strategy into regional execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Activate global enablement and GTM priorities across EMEA Mid-Market, Enterprise, and Strategic teams, adapting execution to regional business and market needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diagnose and improve field execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Use performance data, Gong insights, field observation, and active deals to identify seller and manager gaps, deliver targeted interventions, and scale what “good” looks like across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable frontline managers:&lt;/strong&gt; Equip managers with practical frameworks, tools, and insights to inspect, coach, and reinforce consistent execution and sustainable behavior change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead across teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive complex, cross-functional initiatives that shape how the field sells and executes the sales motion, aligning stakeholders and scaling best practices across Revenue and adjacent teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner across EMEA Revenue:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the regional enablement point of contact for BDRs, Solutions Consultants, GTM Engineers, and the broader Revenue organization, partnering with functional owners to activate global programs and priorities locally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modernize how we enable:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion AI-augmented enablement and modern GTM technology to create scalable, personalized, in-the-flow learning experiences, while bringing EMEA field insights back into global GTM and enablement strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in Sales or Revenue Enablement, Field Enablement, Learning, Program Management, or a related GTM role, ideally in SaaS or another high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience operating as a strategic partner to Sales Leadership and frontline managers, with a track record of improving seller execution and business performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting and activating global onboarding programs at the regional level, including partnering with program owners, frontline managers, and new hires to improve ramp and time to productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex, cross-functional initiatives that have shaped how the field sells or how a GTM organization executes its sales motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to operate with autonomy in ambiguous environments—identifying the problem, setting direction, aligning stakeholders, and driving work from strategy through execution and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to identify, codify, and scale best practices across teams, functions, and adjacent organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with GTM technology and modern revenue workflows, including how technology supports prospecting, pipeline generation, deal execution, forecasting, and customer growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with AI and AI-augmented ways of working, including hands-on experience developing creative AI-enabled approaches to learning, enablement, productivity, and field execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of sales methodologies such as MEDDPICC, Command of the Message, or BANT, with experience turning methodology into practical seller behaviors, manager coaching, reinforcement, and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing scalable, blended learning and everboarding programs that build proficiency and reinforce learning in the flow of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence senior leaders, frontline managers, and cross-functional stakeholders without formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgment working across global and regional organizations, balancing global consistency with the needs of local markets and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent facilitation, coaching, written, and verbal communication skills, with the ability to simplify complexity and create clarity in build-from-scratch environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder mindset and comfort moving between strategic thinking and hands-on execution in a fast-moving, high-growth organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;We are AI Native&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apollo.io is an AI-native company built on a culture of continuous improvement. We’re on the front lines of driving productivity for our customers—and we expect the same mindset from our team. If you&#39;re energized by finding smarter, faster ways to get things done using AI and automation, you&#39;ll thrive here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why You’ll Love Working at Apollo&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Apollo, we’re driven by a shared mission: to help our customers unlock their full revenue potential. That’s why we &lt;strong&gt;take extreme ownership&lt;/strong&gt; of our work, &lt;strong&gt;move with focus and urgency&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;learn voraciously&lt;/strong&gt; to stay ahead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest deeply in your growth, ensuring you have the resources, support, and autonomy to&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;own your role and make a real impact&lt;/strong&gt;. Collaboration is at our core—we’re &lt;strong&gt;all for one&lt;/strong&gt;, meaning you’ll have a team across departments ready to help you succeed. We encourage &lt;strong&gt;bold ideas and courageous action&lt;/strong&gt;, giving you the freedom to experiment, take smart risks, and drive big wins.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re looking for a place where your work matters, where you can push boundaries, and where your career can thrive—Apollo is the place for you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.apollo.io/we-are-apollo&quot;&gt;here!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

