&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior ll GTM Enablement Specialist to join our team in Manila, Philippines. In this role, you will help drive and evolve our end-to-end enablement program, with a primary focus on new hire onboarding, content development, and ongoing education for our Support organization.&amp;nbsp;You will lead in-person facilitation, partner closely with local operations teams, collaborate with enablement peers, and make data-driven recommendations to improve performance and support key business goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who is both a strong facilitator and a thoughtful program builder. You thrive in fast-paced environments, understand the nuances of SaaS support, and know how to translate performance metrics into targeted enablement strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
