&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer on the &lt;strong&gt;Growth team&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be a critical part of our growing company, working at the intersection of engineering, product, marketing, and data science to accelerate product growth through rapid experimentation, data analysis, and scalable technical solutions. You’ll implement and drive best practices in technology, architecture, and process while optimizing funnels, automating growth loops, and shipping features that drive measurable impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll have the chance to work in an open and collaborative environment, receive and give hands-on mentorship, and have opportunities to grow and accelerate your career. You love both learning and teaching, enjoy working cross-functionally to solve hard problems, and strive for quality — obsessing over automation, performance, and squashing any bugs that sneak through.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our tech stack:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ruby/RoR, React.js, TypeScript, Redux, Node.js, Python, MongoDB, Elasticsearch, Ansible, Terraform, Grafana, Kibana, Docker, Kubernetes, AWS/GCP, GitHub Actions.&lt;/p&gt;
