&lt;li&gt;Leverage automation and machine learning to optimize user engagement, reduce churn, and personalize user experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce clean, well-structured, well-documented code and implement pixel-perfect designs that work across browsers, per spec&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain code quality, organization, automation, and continuous delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure technical excellence through best practices in performance optimization, security, and scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively communicate development progress or blockers to the product lead, engineering manager, and other stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work effectively as part of a large global team; attend and engage in stand-ups, team meetings, and manager 1:1s&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give and receive constructive feedback and praise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Competencies&lt;/h2&gt;
