&lt;li&gt;Actively seeks out and acts on feedback as a tool for growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident in owning their role and bringing creative ideas to users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent leadership and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and a bias toward action; obsession with metrics (LTV, CAC, retention) and rapid iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
