&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leveraging AI tools to enhance software development (code generation, debugging, productivity optimization), with fluency integrating AI-driven solutions into your workflow and a willingness to stay current with emerging AI technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS in Computer Science, or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 5 years of industry experience in frontend or full-stack development, building large-scale applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in JavaScript (ES6)/TypeScript, React, Redux, HTML, CSS, and at least one backend language (Ruby/RoR, Python, or Node.js)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud infrastructure (AWS/GCP) and REST APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with analytics tools (Amplitude, Mixpanel, Google Analytics) and A/B testing platforms (e.g., Optimizely, LaunchDarkly, Segment)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with growth frameworks (e.g., Pirate Metrics, viral loops)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong UX and product sense, with the ability to negotiate the right MVP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail; interest in building UI with performance, accessibility, and scalability in mind&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with growth at a startup or scaling product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of SEO, CRM tools (Braze, HubSpot), or marketing automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
